            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20392302?u=5dcac116a63e4eaf0fd7243fdf8e9139962831ae&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">…of $(\"&lt;/div&gt;\")</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Corrected HTML tag in jQuery example for clarity.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41907",
            "title": "docs(WebExtensions): fix jQuery example typo, use $(\"<div>\") instead …",
            "date_modified": "2025-11-12T01:29:12.000Z",
